Subject: [PATCH 2/2] =?UTF-8?q?Na=20fala,=20"220=C2=B0C"=20e'=20"220=20gra?=
 =?UTF-8?q?us"=20=E2=80=94=20e=20nao=20duas=20vezes?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
